                  exemplar: "Experiential Learning/Structured Talk for Learning: Watch a video/demonstrate how to make arrangement of fullness. Make samples of fullness used in clothing construction.\n E.g.\n       Pleats\n       Darts\n       Gathers\n       Tucks, etc.\n Note: teacher/facilitator goes round to observe learners work and guide them.\nExhibit samples of work for appraisal by both teachers and peers. Learners should be honest in appraising their peer's work/product.",
