                  text: "Demonstrate the steps in constructing different types of openings.",
                  exemplar: "Experiential Learning /Structured Talk for Learning Approaches: Watch a video/demonstrate for learners to observe how to make openings and fix fasteners. Make samples of openings and fix appropriate fasteners or closures.\n\n Group Work/Project Based Approaches: In mixed gender/ability/random groups, make samples of openings on articles and fix appropriate fasteners /closures. In your groups, make openings/fastening on your individual project articles and fix appropriate fasteners or closures.\n\n Note: teacher/facilitator goes round, observes learners work and guides them.",
